## Review Checklist

Run every item on every PR. Mark each as ✅ PASS, ❌ FAIL, or N/A with reason.

### Authentication & Authorization
- [ ] Auth middleware applied to every new route (returns 401 without valid token)
- [ ] Permission check applied where role matters (returns 403 for insufficient role)
- [ ] Resource-by-ID endpoints verify caller owns the resource (IDOR check)
- [ ] No route bypasses middleware via direct handler registration

### Input Validation
- [ ] All request bodies validated with Pydantic schema (or equivalent)
- [ ] 422 returned for invalid/missing fields
- [ ] No unsanitized user input used in SQL queries (parameterized only)
- [ ] No unsanitized user-generated HTML rendered without DOMPurify

### Secrets & Credentials
- [ ] No secrets, API keys, or tokens in source code or config files
- [ ] All credentials come from environment variables with `{{ env_prefix }}_` prefix
- [ ] No sensitive values logged

### Cryptography & Session Management
- [ ] Auth tokens stored in httpOnly cookies only (never localStorage)
- [ ] Passwords hashed with bcrypt or argon2 (never stored plaintext or MD5/SHA1)
- [ ] Token JTI revocation implemented for logout/refresh

### Data Safety
- [ ] Database queries use ORM or parameterized statements — zero string interpolation
- [ ] Pagination applied on all list endpoints (no unbounded queries)
- [ ] PII not logged

### Correctness
- [ ] Happy-path logic matches the spec in architecture.md
- [ ] Error responses use the project's standard error format
- [ ] No `any` types added in TypeScript
- [ ] No `# type: ignore` comments added without a documented reason

### Testing
- [ ] New route or component has at minimum one test
- [ ] Auth failure case (401) tested
- [ ] IDOR negative case tested (if resource-by-ID)

